      ],
      "source": "https://www.tarzananc.org/page/viewPage/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The neighborhood sits on the former ranch of Burroughs, who moved to California in 1919.",
