      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tarzana%2C_Los_Angeles",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tarzan Museum and History Committee, founded in 2002, preserves photographs and memorabilia of the town’s heritage.",
